            <article class="policy-card">
                <div class="notice">
                    Please follow these guidelines when accessing or using ViralMMSVideo.
                    They are intended to help protect users, affected individuals, and the
                    Platform from unlawful or harmful activity.
                </div>

                <section id="purpose">
                    <h2>1. Purpose</h2>
                    <p>These Community Guidelines explain the standards expected when using
                        ViralMMSVideo and describe categories of conduct and content that are not permitted.</p>
                    <p>These Guidelines should be read together with our
                        <a href="/terms.html">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>,
                        <a href="/content-safety.html">Content Safety</a>,
                        <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>, and
                        <a href="/report-abuse.html">Report Abuse</a> page.
                    </p>
                    <p>ViralMMSVideo does not currently provide a general public upload function.
                        Content displayed on the Platform may be collected, processed, reviewed,
                        organized, or published through authorized processes and sources.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="adults">
                    <h2>2. Adults Only</h2>
                    <p>ViralMMSVideo is intended only for adults.</p>
                    <p>You must be at least <strong>18 years old</strong>, or the age of majority
                        applicable to you in your jurisdiction, whichever is higher, to access or use the Platform.</p>
                    <p>You must not access or use the Platform if you are under the required age in your jurisdiction.
                    </p>
                    <p>Sexual content involving minors and material facilitating the sexual exploitation of minors are
                        strictly prohibited.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="lawful">
                    <h2>3. Lawful Use</h2>
                    <p>Users must comply with applicable laws and must not use the Platform for unlawful purposes.</p>
                    <p>Do not use ViralMMSVideo to facilitate, promote, organize, or participate in criminal or
                        otherwise unlawful activity.</p>
                    <p>Content or conduct that violates applicable law may be reported to appropriate authorities where
                        legally required or appropriate.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="consent">
                    <h2>4. Consent &amp; Privacy</h2>
                    <p>Respect the privacy, consent, image, likeness, and other rights of people depicted in or affected
                        by content.</p>
                    <p>The following are not permitted:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>non-consensual intimate imagery;</li>
                        <li>intimate material distributed without required consent;</li>
                        <li>private or sensitive material published without authorization;</li>
                        <li>unauthorized use of another person's likeness;</li>
                        <li>impersonation or manipulated material used to harm or deceive a person; and</li>
                        <li>other serious privacy violations.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>If you are affected by material that violates your privacy or consent, please use the
                        <a href="/report-abuse.html">Report Abuse</a> process.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="prohibited">
                    <h2>5. Prohibited Content</h2>
                    <p>The following categories of material are prohibited:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>child sexual abuse material (CSAM);</li>
                        <li>sexual content involving minors;</li>
                        <li>sexual exploitation of minors;</li>
                        <li>trafficking or exploitation;</li>
                        <li>non-consensual intimate imagery;</li>
                        <li>unlawful sexual deepfakes or synthetic intimate material;</li>
                        <li>unlawful privacy violations;</li>
                        <li>content facilitating criminal activity;</li>
                        <li>malware, phishing, fraud, or malicious software;</li>
                        <li>unlawfully obtained personal information; and</li>
                        <li>other material prohibited by applicable law.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Credible reports involving prohibited material may result in removal,
                        restriction, investigation, or other appropriate action.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="ai">
                    <h2>6. AI-Generated &amp; Manipulated Material</h2>
                    <p>Digital editing, synthetic media, and artificial-intelligence technologies
                        may be used to create or modify material.</p>
                    <p>Technology does not make otherwise unlawful material acceptable.
                        Unlawful synthetic material, including material depicting minors or unlawful
                        non-consensual intimate imagery, is prohibited.</p>
                    <p>If manipulated material depicts you without appropriate authorization or consent,
                        report it promptly through the <a href="/report-abuse.html">Report Abuse</a> process.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="copyright">
                    <h2>7. Copyright &amp; Rights</h2>
                    <p>Respect intellectual-property rights. Do not knowingly submit, distribute,
                        or facilitate unauthorized use of copyrighted material.</p>
                    <p>Copyright owners or authorized representatives may submit complaints to:</p>
                    <p><a href="mailto:dmca@viralmmsvideo.dpdns.org"><strong>dmca@viralmmsvideo.dpdns.org</strong></a>
                    </p>
                    <p>Copyright complaints should identify the protected work, the relevant material
                        and URL, and enough information to evaluate the claim.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="respect">
                    <h2>8. Respectful Conduct</h2>
                    <p>Users should communicate and interact responsibly.</p>
                    <p>Do not use the Platform to threaten, harass, intimidate, stalk, impersonate,
                        defraud, or deliberately target people with harmful conduct.</p>
                    <p>Good-faith criticism and lawful disagreement are not, by themselves, violations of these
                        Guidelines.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="security">
                    <h2>9. Security &amp; Abuse</h2>
                    <p>Do not attempt to compromise the security, availability, or integrity of the Platform.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Do not deploy malware or malicious software.</li>
                        <li>Do not conduct phishing or fraudulent activity.</li>
                        <li>Do not attempt unauthorized access to systems or accounts.</li>
                        <li>Do not intentionally interfere with Platform operations.</li>
                        <li>Do not use automated activity to abuse or disrupt the service.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Security concerns should be reported promptly so they can be investigated and addressed where
                        appropriate.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="reporting">
                    <h2>10. Reporting Violations</h2>
                    <p>If you believe material or conduct violates these Guidelines, applicable law,
                        privacy rights, consent requirements, or our other policies, please report it.</p>
                    <p>A useful report should include:</p>
                    <ol>
                        <li>the exact URL or other identifying information;</li>
                        <li>a clear description of the problem;</li>
                        <li>the reason you believe it violates a policy or law; and</li>
                        <li>enough information for us to evaluate the report.</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p>Use our <a href="/report-abuse.html">Report Abuse</a> page for reporting instructions.</p>
                    <p>For privacy, NCII, minor-safety, or other potentially unlawful-content complaints,
                        clearly mark the subject: <strong>URGENT — CONTENT REMOVAL REQUEST</strong></p>
                </section>

                <section id="moderation">
                    <h2>11. Moderation &amp; Removal</h2>
                    <p>Where permitted or required by applicable law, we may:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>remove or disable access to content;</li>
                        <li>correct inaccurate information;</li>
                        <li>restrict access to particular material;</li>
                        <li>prevent material from being republished;</li>
                        <li>investigate complaints;</li>
                        <li>use technical measures to identify previously reported material;</li>
                        <li>preserve information where legally required; and</li>
                        <li>cooperate with lawful requests from courts or competent authorities.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Automated systems may assist with content discovery, categorization,
                        moderation, or publication, but automated systems can make mistakes.
                        We do not guarantee that every potentially problematic item will be detected before publication.
                    </p>
                    <p>Good-faith reports may be reviewed and may result in correction, restriction,
                        removal, or other appropriate action.</p>
                </section>

                <section id="contact">
                    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
